>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Prograam faraay: 0.

>> txt := ['World Salad'].
Génn bind: ['this text contains: '] + ( ( txt xaaj: [' '] ) waññ ) + [' words.'], taxaw.
txt := txt dale: 6 guddaay: 4.
Génn bind: txt, taxaw.

Prograam faaral-njaboot.

usedMemory1 := (Prograam xalaat ? 0).


